 what music and atmosphere you want to train along with, from a long list of songs and genres.\nAnd you choose if you want extra motivation and encouragement when you train - or not.\n\nSalvador Boxing allows you to control every aspect of your training experience, providing you with a rich toolset for mastering pro boxing.\nYou train at your own pace - you choose if you want to listen to music and what music you want to listen to while training - without worrying if your punch hits on the beat or not!\nSalvador is your private boxing instructor.\nLearn pro boxing now with Salvador VR!", "short_description": "Fun boxing in the galaxy,\nLearn boxing - the fun way!\nStay fit, in shape, while having great fun learning pro boxing!\nHooks, uppercuts, punches and dodges - and all the skills you need to master in order to become champion of the galaxy!\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/6f2a6f09-9d22-45df-9403-e19805c526df", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Salvador", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/639737564050715", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "FIGHTING", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["de", "ko", "en", "fr", "es", "vi", "ja", "pl", "zh_CN", "nl"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "839169827128970"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cov